<template>
 <main class="ability-lab" :style="{'--accent':active.color}">
  <header><div><small>AZURLANE CHESS / ABILITY EFFECT STUDIES</small><h1>让能力被看见<span>07</span></h1><p>烟幕、守护、扫描与火力。为每种舰船特色建立清晰的视觉反馈。</p></div><div class="header-links"><span>已接入战斗 · 保留七项</span><a href="./battle-vfx-preview.html">查看战场接入 ↗</a><a href="./explosion-preview.html">查看爆炸特效 ↗</a></div></header>
  <nav class="categories" aria-label="特效分类"><button v-for="c in ['全部','持续能力','武器反馈','航空特色']" :key="c" :aria-pressed="category===c" @click="category=c">{{c}}</button><span>已接入 7 项特效</span></nav>
  <div class="workbench">
