   <section class="stage-shell">
    <div class="stage-heading"><div><small>{{active.group}} / {{active.ship}}</small><h2>{{active.name}}</h2></div><button class="angle" @click="view(!top)">{{top?'恢复斜视':'俯视观察'}}</button></div>
    <div class="scene" ref="host"><p v-if="error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p v-else-if="!ready" role="status">正在准备特效…</p><div class="stage-foot"><span>{{phase}}</span><span>拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放</span></div></div>
    <div class="transport" aria-label="播放控制"><button class="primary" @click="toggle">{{playing?'暂停':'播放'}}</button><button @click="restart">重新播放</button><button @click="peak">关键时刻</button><label>速度<select aria-label="播放速度" v-model.number="speed"><option :value="1">1×</option><option :value=".5">0.5×</option><option :value=".25">0.25×</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="loop">循环</label></div>
    <div class="timeline"><span>{{time.toFixed(2)}} s</span><input type="range" aria-label="特效时间轴" min="0" :max="active.duration" step=".01" :value="time" @input="scrub"><span>{{active.duration.toFixed(2)}} s</span></div>
   </section>
  </div>
  <section class="description"><div><small>视觉设计</small><p>{{active.summary}}</p></div><div><small>对应现有规则</small><p>{{active.rule}}</p></div></section>
  <details class="audit"><summary>查看全部 15 艘舰船的特效对应</summary><div class="audit-grid"><article v-for="(ids,id) in SHIP_EFFECT_AUDIT" :key="id"><strong>{{SHIP_DEFINITIONS[id].name}}</strong><span>{{effectNames(ids)}}</span></article></div><p>埃塞克斯、香格里拉的普通轰炸机复用上一批飞机轰炸特效。基础武器命中同样复用；没有为单纯耐久、航速差异添加持续光效。</p></details>
  <footer><span>舰体与飞机为展示参照，技能时长按观察节奏编排。</span><span>与战场共用特效；不改变技能规则或战斗数值。</span></footer>
 </main>
</template>
